ctive_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducable in v4.6.stable.official [89cea1439]\n- Also Reproducable in v4.5.1.stable.official [f62fdbde1]\n\n### System information\n\nMacOS 26.1 (25B78) - godot v4.6.stable.official [89cea1439]\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn the editor, if you press capslock (and no text entry widget is focussed), the capslock indicator appears on the top-left.  If you export a project, it also happens in the standalone version.\n\n\n<img width=\"1512\" height=\"982\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/73b4a6f2-6e23-4965-931a-800cdbf8e8a5\" />\n<img width=\"694\" height=\"454\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e8fa3c5e-ecf1-4da8-8046-a1e73c3b1348\" />\n<img width=\"723\" height=\"448\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5030d889-f365-463e-931c-bf4f42f5d6ae\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nObserved behaviour:\n\nTwo cases where it happens:\n* Just open the editor and turn on capslock. Notice the icon in the top-left.\n* Export a project, run it, and turn on capslock. Notice the capslock icon in the top-left of the window.  \n\n\nExpected behaviour - capslock icon only appears when a text-edit field is focussed, and appears beside the field and not floating in the top-left of the window.\n\nIf a text-entry field is focussed, the capslock symbol appears in the correct place:\n\n<img width=\"222\" height=\"149\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bb08fcd0-4ed0-45cd-b346-e63fffd1e0e1\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nAn empty project will produce the behaviour (i added an empty 3d scene and set required fields to export it to test the behaviour in standalone builds, but I think every project should have it). But if you really want, here's my test project:\n\n<!-- Failed to upload \"neues-spiel.zip\" -->","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115555/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115555/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}